- ACPI manifest SHA-256: `2bd690ae0817705b1b128675f9628dd7212fee74ab97c88da3599a1ae8e398f2`.
- Profile: counted `stage4a`, `--set-cpl0 --user-mode`, 128 MiB, budget `3,000,000,000`, expected stop `budget_exhausted`.

